# ============================================================
# Figures / assets policy
# ============================================================
# Do not globally ignore:
#   assets/
#   figures/
#   docs/assets/
#   paper_figures/
# because README images, architecture diagrams, and selected paper figures
# are often useful to track.
#
# Put generated bulk visualizations under outputs/ or results/ so they are ignored.
#
# Do not globally ignore *.pdf by default.
# If needed, ignore only generated reports in a specific output directory, e.g.:
# outputs/**/*.pdf
# results/**/*.pdf